icians to hone their skills, tackle diverse scenarios, and effectively respond to potential challenges.\n\n\ufeffAspiring and experienced technicians alike can gain invaluable experience without exposing themselves to real-world risks, ultimately leading to improved on-the-job performance and a heightened safety consciousness.", "short_description": "Power Line Tech VR is an innovative and immersive training simulator designed to enhance the safety and expertise of power line technicians in the utility industry. Leveraging cutting-edge virtual reality technology, this simulator provides a realistic and interactive environment for power line technicians to hone their skills, tackle diverse scenarios, and effectively respond to potential challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bitspacedevelopment.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BSD XR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.bitspacedevelopment.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7745206708901545"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2629025637493269"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "791356439819010"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1427455357892093"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2629025637493269"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1777381560, "sta